# ROS C++ Style（roslint / cpplint 认可）
# ⚠️ BreakBeforeBraces 必须是 Allman：roslint 的 cpplint_wrapper 强制大括号另起一行
# ⚠️ ColumnLimit 必须是 80：cpplint 默认行宽
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
ColumnLimit: 80
ReflowComments: true
IndentWidth: 2
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
Standard: Cpp11
